messages.content:
{"content": "You did nothing wrong, John. Turning Data Roaming ON was a correct step. The top of your screen still shows "No Signal" because your SIM card is reported as missing, so that is the next thing to fix.

Please reseat your SIM card, which means taking it out and putting it back in so it sits properly. Your pictures are stored on the phone, not on the SIM card, so this will not delete them.

If you are not sure where the SIM slot is, tell me what you see on your phone and we will go slowly. Tell me when you have finished.", "tool_calls": []}

